[00:00.000] 作词 : Wendy Eisenberg
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Wendy Eisenberg
[00:14.427] I tried to deny it
[00:21.143] I knew it would only confuse me
[00:28.963] I tried to refuse it
[00:34.381] I didn't want it to define me
[00:39.825]
[00:41.732] But time has a funny way of laying you bare
[00:48.000] It pulls you, and scares you, and tangles your hair
[00:53.983] Asking, will you dare?
[01:00.161]
[01:14.736] I laugh when I think of the obviousness of my sorrows
[01:28.707] I cry when I remember the lover who once made me laugh
[01:40.017]
[01:41.940] And time is an earless thing, ignoring your cries
[01:48.093] It shapes you, and scrapes you, and makes you ask
[01:52.981] Why did I try? Did I try?
[01:59.377]
[02:01.501] Love's elusiveness is clear to me
[02:07.952] It gets me every time, and I say I like it
[02:15.669] Unilluminated choice for me to be in love
[02:27.383]
[02:42.933] I tried to predict it
[02:50.133] I know that I want her to know me
[02:56.103] I want to preserve it
[03:03.369] I sense it'll only transform me
[03:07.265]
[03:09.456] And time has a funny way of getting you there
[03:15.440] It sees you, believes you, and silvers your hair
[03:20.928] Asking, will you dare?
